<title>GERMANY: Karstadt declines comment on Ahold rumour.</title>
<headline>Karstadt declines comment on Ahold rumour.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Karstadt AG declined comment on Thursday on market rumours that Dutch supermarket group Ahold NV was interested in buying a stake in the German retailer.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not comment on market rumours,&quot; a Karstadt spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Dealers said one factor driving Karstadt shares higher in recent days was speculation that Ahold was a potential buyer of a stake in Karstadt.</p>
<p>Karstadt shares were up 33 marks at 696 marks in midday bourse dealings.</p>
<p>Ahold on Thursday also declined comment on the rumours but said it had no immediate ambitions in the German market.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
